# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. Never commit real keys.
# Default provider is Workers AI (binding `AI`) — no key needed, just `wrangler login`.
#
# To use an OpenAI-compatible API instead, uncomment:
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai
# LLM_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
# LLM_MODEL_FAST=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# LLM_API_KEY=your-key
